confirmed true. Load does not set that. So we need origin_availability_confirmed via something else. There is lock_origin_availability action that sets origin_availability_confirmed true (and origin_availability_locked). Precondition: candidate_prepared, candidate_operator_linked, origin_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, not origin_availability_locked. Effect: origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed.)
