(Thus we need to allocate slot to origin, then dispatch origin (slot becomes available), then allocate slot to destination (slot becomes unavailable). At the end, slot linked to origin and destination (and still linked to shift_candidate_alpha? Actually shift_candidate_alpha still linked from init; we never removed that link. So slot will be linked to three candidates: shift_candidate_alpha, origin_availability_alpha, destination_availability_alpha. That's okay.)
